  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３楼　摊位街\n　“甜蜜地狱”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们正在休息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CD 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}啊，学长——！\n这里的牡丹饼很好吃哦！\n一起来吃吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 06 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 00 0A}{F5 C1 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}，辛苦了。\n我们刚才在聊\n我和理世的事。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8C 0D}风花和理世的能力极为特殊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然不能攻击阴影，\n却能使用人格面具，\n为同伴提供各种信息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，迷宫的结构\n我们可就不知道了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}你们两人的性能有区别吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 0B}嗯……\n虽然都是支援型，\n但确实有一些不同呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F6 04}战斗时，我可以{F2 01 03 01}让某个同伴\n更早行动{F2 01 01 01}哦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B0 11}更早行动？\n是让速度变快的意思吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯，比如有人受伤了，\n就希望能治疗的同伴\n比敌人先行动，对吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 86 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}原来如此……让指定的同伴\n先于敌人行动，\n便可能成为扭转战局的契机。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不只是治疗，\n进攻时也很有效。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}风花还能进行{F2 01 03 01}辅助恢复{F2 01 01 01}呢！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}辅助恢复？\n和普通的恢复不同吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}{F2 01 03 01}持续恢复大家的体力{F2 01 01 01}。\n因为是慢慢恢复，\n所以单次的恢复量并不大……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 BD 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}使用一次以后，\n就会持续恢复体力吗？\n是很有效的支援能力。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}也就是说……\n理世负责“进攻”，风花负责“治愈”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DE 04}嗯……\n虽然概括得很粗略，\n但大致就是这样吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}是、是呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_022.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}无论如何，根据前线的攻守平衡，\n以及探索目的，\n来更换支援人员应该比较好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
